  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCORD, 2012-2017 - ACCORD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACCORD, 2012-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCORD is an independent conflict management NGO based in Durban,     South Africa, working i.a. on mediation on conflicts, technical       advice in certain countries, training and policy formulation. Sida is providing core support to the organisation. A partnership with the    Department for Conflict Resolution at Uppsala University is also      financed by Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACCORD &#xe4;r en oberoende organisation som arbetar med                   konflikthantering, baserad i Durban, Sydafrika. De arbetar bl.a. med  medling i konflikter, tekniskt st&#xf6;d i vissa l&#xe4;nder, utbildning och    policyformulering. Sida tillhandah&#xe5;ller generellt organisationsst&#xf6;d   till ACCORD. Ett partnerskap med Avdelningen f&#xf6;r Konfliktl&#xf6;sning vid  Uppsala universitet st&#xf6;ds ocks&#xe5; av Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of ACCORD is &#x201c;to promote and encourage the constructive resolution of disputes by the peoples of Africa and so assist in building political stability, economic recovery and peaceful co-existence within just and democratic societies.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
